{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EY9W1SJmihEwx5P3N2mhFy","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 2026-04-13-prealloc-round0-buffers\n2\t\n3\tPre-allocate per-thread reusable GPU buffers for Round 0 constraint and interaction evaluation to eliminate per-AIR cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync serialization across 8 worker threads. Round 0 currently allocates 6 temporary DeviceBuffers per AIR (intermediates, temp_sums, sp_evals for both zerocheck constraints and logup interactions), causing ~2,400 mutex acquisitions and CUDA memory pool cross-stream synchronization per segment. This is the same bottleneck that the GKR input eval pre-allocation (task 2026-04-13-2100) eliminated for a 1.67x improvement; Round 0 at 296ms has even more per-AIR allocations and exhibits the same symptom of equal seg0/seg1 wall times despite very different workloads.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bb129e0-2d55-41ce-bfd8-6ccf294e6721","uuid":"0615d169-7cf6-4642-81cc-ef700a4c224a","timestamp":"2026-04-13T08:09:33.398Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/georg/stark-backend/autoopt-results/task.md","content":"# 2026-04-13-prealloc-round0-buffers\n\nPre-allocate per-thread reusable GPU buffers for Round 0 constraint and interaction evaluation to eliminate per-AIR cudaMallocAsync/cudaFreeAsync serialization across 8 worker threads. Round 0 currently allocates 6 temporary DeviceBuffers per AIR (intermediates, temp_sums, sp_evals for both zerocheck constraints and logup interactions), causing ~2,400 mutex acquisitions and CUDA memory pool cross-stream synchronization per segment. This is the same bottleneck that the GKR input eval pre-allocation (task 2026-04-13-2100) eliminated for a 1.67x improvement; Round 0 at 296ms has even more per-AIR allocations and exhibits the same symptom of equal seg0/seg1 wall times despite very different workloads.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}}}
