, Round0EvalError> {\n148\t    // Check if this trace has interactions\n149\t    if eq_3bs.is_empty() {\n150\t        return Ok(DeviceBuffer::new());\n151\t    }\n152\t    let large_domain = num_cosets * skip_domain;\n153\t\n154\t    // We create a new \"interactions DAG\" where the new .constraints are the interaction [count,\n155\t    // message_0, message_1, ..] expressions themselves, while the .interactions are empty\n156\t    // We track the indices with InteractionNode\n157\t\n158\t    // Copied from build_symbolic_constraints_dag to handle sorting of constraints\n159\t    // NOTE: For logup round0, the kernel uses weights indexed by rule_idx, not constraint_idx.\n160\t    // So we deduplicate constraint_idx and use dag_idx_to_rule_idx for weight mapping.\n161\t    let (rules, d_numer_weights, d_denom_weights, denom_sum_init) = {\n162\t        let mut dag_builder = SymbolicDagBuilder::new();\n163\t        let mut sorted_used_dag_idxs = Vec::new();\n164\t        for interaction in &symbolic.interactions {\n165\t            let count = dag_builder.add_expr(&interaction.count);\n166\t            sorted_used_dag_idxs.push(count);\n167\t            sorted_used_dag_idxs.extend(\n168\t                interaction\n169\t                    .message\n170\t                    .iter()\n171\t                    .map(|field_expr| dag_builder.add_expr(field_expr)),\n172\t            );\n173\t        }\n174\t        sorted_used_dag_idxs.sort();\n175\t        // Deduplicate for the dag since logup round0 kernel doesn't use used_nodes\n176\t        sorted_used_dag_idxs.dedup();\n177\t        let dag = SymbolicExpressionDag {\n178\t            nodes: dag_builder.nodes,\n179\t            constraint_idx: sorted_used_dag_idxs,\n180\t        };\n181\t        let rules = SymbolicRulesGpu::new(&dag, true);\n182\t        let mut numer_weights = vec![EF::ZERO; rules.rules.len()];\n183\t        let mut denom_weights = vec![EF::ZERO; rules.rules.len()];\n184\t        let mut denom_sum_in