{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01RFDziz1fvx38GvTMbxTzHm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Final after-measurements:\n\nAPC 300:\n- Round 0: 443ms (before: 296ms, +147ms, 1.50x slower)\n- GKR: 727ms (before: 539ms, +188ms, 1.35x slower)\n- STARK excl trace: 1779ms (before: 1442ms, +337ms, 1.23x slower)\n- APC 0: STARK excl trace: 2165ms (before: 2134ms, +31ms)\n\n\n- Round 0: 177ms (before: 177ms, no change)\n- GKR: 1030ms (before: 1001ms, +29ms)\n\nAPC 100 shows similar degradation patterns with Round 0 taking 385ms versus the previous 250ms, GKR jumping from 644ms to 855ms, and STARK excluding trace time increasing from 1604ms to 1953ms. The data reveals a consistent regression across all APC configurations with multiple AIRs.\n\nLooking at the success criteria, the optimization clearly fails—Round 0 at APC 300 hit 443ms when it needed to stay under 240ms, and STARK excl trace at APC 300 reached 1779ms instead of the 1380ms target. The rollback thresholds are also breached since both metrics regressed significantly rather than improving. I need to commit this implementation and then revert it.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2971,"cache_read_input_tokens":163587,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2971},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bb129e0-2d55-41ce-bfd8-6ccf294e6721","uuid":"de993e89-9147-47cf-8ab8-5333244b7fde"}
